// The guard on Eppillos's pit. Can be bought for one night.
=== start
[quest pit=guard_paid] -> paid
"Keep back from the edge." He sniffs, wipes his nose on his sleeve. "King's prisoner. Nobody talks to him, nobody feeds him, nobody looks at him funny."
* [quest pit active, !flag pit_alarm, silver 60] "Cold night for it. Sixty silver says you'd rather be by a fire, around moonrise." -> bribe ~ silver -60
* [quest pit active, !flag pit_alarm, barter 40, silver 35] "Thirty-five, and nobody ever knows. You'll have that cold till spring otherwise." -> bribe ~ silver -35
* "Who is he?" -> who
* "Goodbye." -> END

=== who
"Old Ategnatos's boy. Sent a rider to Gobannitio." He spits into the pit, but not quite at the man in it. "Stupid. He was all right, before. Bought a round in the winter, at the feast." He shrugs. "King's prisoner."
* "Goodbye." -> END

=== bribe
~ quest pit guard_paid
He looks at the silver, and at the pit, and at the sky. "Moonrise," he says. "There's a fire in the granary yard. I'll be at it. If anyone asks, I was there all night and I saw nothing, which is true."
* "Moonrise." -> END

=== paid
"Moonrise," he says, not looking at you. "I've got a fire to get to."
* "Go on, then." -> END
